cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LingualDub in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "LingualDub: A Composable, Registry-Based Speech-AI Framework for Low-Resource Languages"
authors:
  - name: "LingualDub Authors and Contributors"
url: "https://github.com/allaninfo-tech/lingualdub"
repository-code: "https://github.com/allaninfo-tech/lingualdub"
abstract: >
  LingualDub is an open, modular speech-AI framework designed for low-resource languages.
  It standardises language metadata, resource management, capability-checked pipeline composition,
  provenance-tracked execution, and reproducible cross-lingual evaluation.
keywords:
  - speech-ai
  - low-resource-languages
  - speech-to-speech
  - dubbing
  - asr
  - tts
  - machine-translation
  - luganda
  - runyankole
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.1.0-dev"
date-released: "2026-08-31"
